# 5. PARTIAL AI AVAILABILITY

Example:

```text
Document contains 20 facts

18 APPROVED
2 CONFLICT
```

The AI may continue using the 18 approved facts.

It must avoid the two unresolved facts.

If the customer asks:

> “Where are you located?”

and location is approved:

```text
AI answers normally.
```

If the customer asks:

> “How much is consultation?”

and consultation price is conflicted:

```text
AI does not guess.
```

This fact-level behavior is mandatory.

